    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-article\"><header><strong>Knowix</strong><h1>如何使用 Treg 构建 AI 外联引擎</h1></header><div class=\"tw-article-body\"><p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">大多数外联都是靠猜。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你构建一个列表，群发上百封邮件，然后指望其中有人会在意。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">I wanted to find founders who care </span><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">right now</span><span data-text=\"true\">, the moment they announce a launch.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">我想找到那些在发布产品那一刻就真正在意的创始人。</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">所以我构建了一个正好能做到这一点的引擎。</span></p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">105 条线索。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">3 个电话预约。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">1 笔交易已成交。</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">总计 $2.87。</span></span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTZJkUyXYAANrlr?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">导语列表是累赘</span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">A lead list tells you who </span><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">might</span><span data-text=\"true\"> fit. It doesn't tell you:</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">一份潜在客户名单只能告诉你谁可能合适。它不会告诉你：</font></font></font></p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">When</span><span data-text=\"true\"> they need you</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">他们什么时候需要你</font></font></font></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">What</span><span data-text=\"true\"> to say to them</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">该对他们说什么</font></font></font></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Who</span><span data-text=\"true\"> actually makes the call</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">究竟是谁在做决定</font></font></font></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">所以这三个问题你都靠猜，你的邮件读起来就像在猜。这就是它被忽略的原因。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\">This engine answers all three</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">When:</span><span data-text=\"true\"> it catches founders the moment they post about a launch, while they're actively thinking about getting seen.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">时机：它在创始人发布产品的那一刻就捕捉到他们，那时他们正积极思考如何获得关注。</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">What to say:</span><span data-text=\"true\"> every lead arrives with the post that triggered it. You're not cold pitching; you're replying to something they just said. Your opener writes itself.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">该说什么：每条线索都附带触发它的帖子。你不是在冷推销，而是在回应他们刚刚说的话。你的开场白自然而然就有了。</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Who:</span><span data-text=\"true\"> it goes past the company and finds the decision maker. It surfaced 50 founders and CEOs with work emails, not info@ inboxes.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">谁：它绕过公司，找到决策者。它挖掘出 50 位创始人和 CEO 的工作邮箱，而不是 info@收件箱。</font></font></font></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTZKWq8WYAAmV8I?format=png&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">Our service helps AI brands get their launches seen on X, and a founder mid launch doesn't need convincing that attention matters. The engine just makes sure I show up at the right moment.</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\">The results</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\">162 companies researched → </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">29 qualified brands</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">研究了162家公司 → 29个合格品牌</font></font></font></li><li><span data-text=\"true\">560 launch posts scanned → </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">38 launch leads</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">扫描了560条发布帖 → 38条发布线索</font></font></font></li><li><span data-text=\"true\">231 founder posts → </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">38 qualified leads</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">231条创始人帖子 → 38条合格线索</font></font></font></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">That adds up to </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">105 leads, 3 booked calls and 1 closed deal.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">总计获得105条线索、3个预约通话和1笔成交交易。</font></font></font></p>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\">The cost: under 3 cents a lead</span></h1>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1,434 data calls: $2.77</span><span data-text=\"true\">, about 0.2 cents each</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">1,434次数据调用：2.77美元，每次约0.2美分</font></font></font></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">AI judging: about $0.10</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">231 founder posts → 38 qualified leads for two cents</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">That's $2.87 for the whole run. \nNo subscriptions and no lead list invoice.</span></p>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\">The secret: one key from Treg</span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">Catching founders at launch means watching X, LinkedIn and Reddit, researching each company, and finding the right person's email. Normally that's five tools, five keys and five monthly bills.</span></p>\n<p><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.com/@treg_ai\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">@treg_ai</span></a></div></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">That's what makes the $2.87 possible, and it's why you can build this yourself.</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\">How to build it</span></h2>\n<p><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"//treg.to\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">treg.to</span></a></div></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2. Connect your agent</span><span data-text=\"true\">\nPaste this into Claude Code, Codex or any agent:</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">2. 连接你的代理\n将此粘贴到 Claude Code、Codex 或任何 agent 中：</font></font></font></p>\n<p><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://treg.to/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://treg.to/llms.txt</span></a></div></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3. Define your signal</span><span data-text=\"true\">\nDecide what a post looks like when someone needs you. For me, it's founders saying they're launching or just launched an AI product.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">3. 定义你的信号\n确定当有人需要你时，帖子是什么样的。对我来说，就是创始人说他们正在发布或刚刚发布了一款 AI 产品。</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">4. Discover</span><span data-text=\"true\">\nHave your agent search X, LinkedIn and Reddit for those signals through Treg.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">4. 发现\n让你的代理通过 Treg 在 X、LinkedIn 和 Reddit 上搜索这些信号。</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">5. Filter for free</span><span data-text=\"true\">\nDrop obvious noise with plain rules before you spend a cent.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">5. 免费筛选\n在花一分钱之前，先用简单规则剔除明显的噪音。</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">6. Enrich, then judge</span><span data-text=\"true\">\nPull company details through Treg, then have a JEV judge answer one sharp question. Mine is: \"Is this a real AI product with room to grow on X?\"</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">6. 先丰富信息，再评判\n通过 Treg 拉取公司详情，然后让 JEV 评判员回答一个尖锐的问题。我的问题是：“这是一个真正的 AI 产品，并且在 X 上有增长空间吗？”</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">7. Pay for contacts last</span><span data-text=\"true\">\nLook up decision makers and work emails only for leads that passed.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">7. 最后为联系人付费\n只为通过筛选的潜在客户查找决策者和工作邮箱。</font></font></font></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">8. You send</span><span data-text=\"true\">\nThe engine finds, qualifies and drafts. You review and hit send.</span><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">8. 你发送\n引擎负责寻找、筛选并起草。你负责审核并点击发送。</font></font></font></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\">Start yours</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">$2.87 in, one closed deal out.</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">If you're building agents that need data from more than one place, start with Treg. </span></p>\n<p><div class=\"css-g5y9jx r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.com/@knowixbuilds\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">@knowixbuilds</span></a></div></p></div></article>",
    "pageContent": "大多数外联都是靠猜。\n你构建一个列表，群发上百封邮件，然后指望其中有人会在意。\nI wanted to find founders who care right now, the moment they announce a launch.我想找到那些在发布产品那一刻就真正在意的创始人。\n所以我构建了一个正好能做到这一点的引擎。\n105 条线索。\n3 个电话预约。\n1 笔交易已成交。\n总计 $2.87。\n导语列表是累赘\nA lead list tells you who might fit. It doesn't tell you:一份潜在客户名单只能告诉你谁可能合适。它不会告诉你：\nWhen they need you他们什么时候需要你\nWhat to say to them该对他们说什么\nWho actually makes the call究竟是谁在做决定\n所以这三个问题你都靠猜，你的邮件读起来就像在猜。这就是它被忽略的原因。\nThis engine answers all three\nWhen: it catches founders the moment they post about a launch, while they're actively thinking about getting seen.时机：它在创始人发布产品的那一刻就捕捉到他们，那时他们正积极思考如何获得关注。\nWhat to say: every lead arrives with the post that triggered it. You're not cold pitching; you're replying to something they just said. Your opener writes itself.\nWho: it goes past the company and finds the decision maker. It surfaced 50 founders and CEOs with work emails, not info@ inboxes.\nOur service helps AI brands get their launches seen on X, and a founder mid launch doesn't need convincing that attention matters. The engine just makes sure I show up at the right moment.\nThe results\n162 companies researched → 29 qualified brands\n560 launch posts scanned → 38 launch leads\n231 founder posts → 38 qualified leads\nThat adds up to 105 leads, 3 booked calls and 1 closed deal.\nThe cost: under 3 cents a lead\n1,434 data calls: $2.77, about 0.2 cents each\nAI judging: about $0.10\n231 founder posts → 38 qualified leads for two cents\nThat's $2.87 for the whole run. No subscriptions and no lead list invoice.\nThe secret: one key from Treg\nCatching founders at launch means watching X, LinkedIn and Reddit, researching each company, and finding the right person's email. Normally that's five tools, five keys and five monthly bills.\n@treg_ai\nThat's what makes the $2.87 possible, and it's why you can build this yourself.\nHow to build it\ntreg.to\n2. Connect your agent\nPaste this into Claude Code, Codex or any agent:\nhttps://treg.to/llms.txt\n3. Define your signal\nDecide what a post looks like when someone needs you. For me, it's founders saying they're launching or just launched an AI product.\n4. Discover\nHave your agent search X, LinkedIn and Reddit for those signals through Treg.\n5. Filter for free\nDrop obvious noise with plain rules before you spend a cent.\n6. Enrich, then judge\nPull company details through Treg, then have a JEV judge answer one sharp question. Mine is: \"Is this a real AI product with room to grow on X?\"\n7. Pay for contacts last\nLook up decision makers and work emails only for leads that passed.\n8. You send\nThe engine finds, qualifies and drafts. You review and hit send.\nStart yours\n$2.87 in, one closed deal out.\nIf you're building agents that need data from more than one place, start with Treg. @knowixbuilds"
  },
